<http://data.silknow.org/object/3fad4838-635d-3865-ab26-71442f0332a2/observation/1>
        a                   crmsci:S4_Observation ;
        ecrm:P2_has_type    <http://data.silknow.org/observation/technical-observation> ;
        ecrm:P3_has_note    "Dress fabric of brocaded silk. The silk has a pale coffee coloured ground with a brocaded design in coloured silks. A brown stem with exotic flowers, sweat peas and pea-pods form the main design. There are feathers in pairs and a pink hydrangea-like flower between the main stem. The technique is brocaded gros de tours with a binding warp thread taken from the ground. The design is bound in 3/1 twill. The découpure is 7 threads, about 640 threads to the inch 500 cords in design approx.\n\nSelvedge is 0.25 inch plain tabby with one pink stripe and one outer cord."@en ;
        crmsci:O8_observed  <http://data.silknow.org/object/3fad4838-635d-3865-ab26-71442f0332a2> .

<http://data.silknow.org/production/a68e1e1a-4d64-3135-86ae-3834a9b2f6ac>
